izing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各项的参数（力常数、平衡值、电荷）由量子化学计算和实验拟合而来，AMBER、CHARMM、OPLS 是主流力场家族。力场是一切结果的精度天花板：它对极化、键的断裂生成等量子效应做了经典近似，所以 MD 看不了化学反应（需量子/混合 QM-MM 方法）。理解力场的近似性，才能判断一个 MD 结果该信几分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分子动力学-逐帧演算运动\">分子动力学：逐帧演算运动</h2><p>有了力场就能算出每个原子的受力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}_i = -\\nabla_i U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1163em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>，再用牛顿第二定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}_i = m_i \\ddot{\\vec{r}}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1163em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1009em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9509em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.283em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推进。MD 把时间切成约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>fs</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{–}2\\,\\text{fs}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fs</span></span></span></span></span></span>（飞秒）的小步，用 Verlet 类积分器反复更新每个原子的位置和速度，攒出一条构象随时间变化的轨迹。在恒温恒压系综里跑，还能模拟生理条件。</p>\n<p>MD 的核心价值是给出<a href=\"protein-folding\">折叠漏斗</a>能量地形上的真实行走：构象涨落、环的开合、水分子进出口袋、结合解离的微观路径。但它有个致命瓶颈——时间尺度。常规 MD 跑到微秒已属奢侈，而许多重要事件（大构象切换、<a href=\"../macromolecules/structure-function\">别构</a>传导、折叠）发生在毫秒甚至更慢。专用超算（如 Anton）和 GPU 集群把可达尺度推到毫秒，但对绝大多数实验室，采样不足仍是头号难题——这催生了伞形采样、副本交换、元动力学等增强采样方法，用偏置势帮体系越过高能垒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分子对接-预测结合姿态\">分子对接：预测结合姿态</h2><p>对接专攻一个更聚焦的问题：给定一个受体（蛋白靶点）和一个配体（小分子或多肽），预测它们结合的三维姿态与大致亲和力。算法在配体的平移、旋转、可旋转键构成的姿态空间里搜索，用打分函数评估每个候选姿态的「好坏」——打分函数是力场的简化版，权衡形状互补、氢键、疏水接触、去溶剂化等。</p>\n<p>对接的两大用途：一是把单个已知配体「摆」进口袋看结合模式；二是虚拟筛选——把几百万个化合物逐一对接打分，挑出最有希望的几十个去实验验证，这是<a href=\"../applications/structure-based-drug-design\">结构基础药物设计</a>的主力工具。对接的软肋在打分函数：它为速度牺牲了精度，姿态排第一名往往对、但亲和力排序常不准；它也常把受体当刚体，忽略<a href=\"../macromolecules/structure-function\">诱导契合</a>的构象适应。近年 <a href=\"alphafold-prediction\">AlphaFold 3</a> 等学习型方法在配体姿态预测上已超越传统对接（约 76% 准确），正在重塑这个领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自由能计算-从定性到定量\">自由能计算：从定性到定量</h2><p>要把结合强度算准而非只排序，需要更严格的自由能方法。自由能微扰（FEP）和热力学积分通过一系列 MD 模拟，沿着一条非物理的「炼金术」路径（比如把配体 A 渐变成配体 B）累积自由能差，能算出两个相似配体结合自由能的差值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Delta G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΔ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，精度可达约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kcal/mol</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{kcal/mol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kcal/mol</span></span></span></span></span></span>，足以指导先导化合物优化。MM-PBSA/GBSA 则是更快但更粗的端点方法。</p>\n<p>这些方法把 MD 从「看运动」升级为「算热力学」，是计算辅助药物设计里最有定量价值的环节。它们也提醒我们 MD 与对接的真正分工：对接快速广撒网选苗子，MD 与 FEP 精算少数候选的结合与动态。把静态预测、动态模拟、定量自由能三者串起来，加上<a href=\"../methods/\">实验方法</a>验证，构成现代计算结构生物学的完整流水线，并直接服务于下一章的<a href=\"../applications/\">应用与前沿</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MD 与对接共享力场——一个把化学相互作用编码进能量函数的经验近似，是精度天花板。</li>\n<li>MD 按牛顿方程逐飞秒积分生成构象轨迹，能看运动与路径，但受时间尺度（采样不足）严重制约。</li>\n<li>增强采样（元动力学、副本交换等）用偏置势帮体系越过高能垒，等效延长可达时间。</li>\n<li>对接在姿态空间搜索结合构象，是虚拟筛选主力，但打分函数精度有限、常忽略受体柔性。</li>\n<li>自由能微扰能定量算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Delta G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΔ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kcal/mol</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{kcal/mol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kcal/mol</span></span></span></span></span></span>），把计算从排序升级为预测，服务<a href=\"../applications/structure-based-drug-design\">药物设计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分子动力学与对接","id":"分子动力学与对接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"力场：把化学装进一个能量函数","id":"力场-把化学装进一个能量函数"},{"level":2,"text":"分子动力学：逐帧演算运动","id":"分子动力学-逐帧演算运动"},{"level":2,"text":"分子对接：预测结合姿态","id":"分子对接-预测结合姿态"},{"level":2,"text":"自由能计算：从定性到定量","id":"自由能计算-从定性到定量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AlphaFold 与结构预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/computational/alphafold-prediction"},"next":{"title":"结构基础药物设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/applications/structure-based-drug-design"}}